OL,3,GNEWSACharity offers to meet James
OL,4,AMcClean over therapy comments
OL,5,
OL,6,FA men's mental health charity has
OL,7,Foffered to meet footballer James
OL,8,FMcClean after he told a newspaper he
OL,9,Fviews speaking to a psychologist as
OL,10,F"weak".
OL,12,FIn an interview with the Sunday
OL,13,FIndependent, the Derry City player said
OL,14,Fhe had never tried therapy because "as
OL,15,Fa man I would see that as a weakness".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
