OL,3,GNEWSACharity offers to meet James
OL,4,AMcClean over therapy comments
OL,5,
OL,6,FMichael Lynch, from Men's Action
OL,7,FNetwork (MAN) based in Londonderry,
OL,8,Fsaid the charity would welcome the
OL,9,Fopportunity to meet with him to discuss
OL,10,Fthe importance of encouraging all men
OL,11,Fto feel comfortable seeking support
OL,12,Fwhen they need it.
OL,14,FMcClean has been contacted for comment.
